{
  "name": "AI Ecosystem — Pre-Conflict (until Feb. 2026)",
  "description": "Multilevel map of the AI ecosystem across the three analytical layers immediately before Operation Epic Fury (US–Israel–Iran, Feb. 28, 2026). Layers: (1) Models — frontier labs; (2) Deployments — integrators and military buyers; (3) Systems — compute infrastructure, chips and geopolitics. Highlights: Palantir as strategic middleware (Maven/TITAN), the Anthropic-Palantir-AWS tripartite partnership (Nov. 2024), GenAI.mil with Google/OpenAI/xAI, and Iran as a latent threat actor (Storm-2035, PLC/HMI attacks). Source: prepared by the author with MultilayerEco. Article: 'AI as Weapon and as Market' (Correia, 2026).",
